QuestGuidance.Register("es",182,{
[5793]="70044536\n1\tAsk Húndil for small ale\tThe Old Guest-house is in the First Circle, just south of the City Gates. Ask Húndil in the Old Guest-house for some small ale.\n2\tAsk at the Wheel and Cask for small ale\tThe Wheel and Cask is at the northern end of the First Circle. The Old Guest-house has run out of small ale, but Húndil thinks the Wheel and Cask might have some.\n3\tGather small ale (total: 6)\tThe Wheel and Cask is at the northern end of the First Circle. Meldis has invited you to collect all the small ale you want yourself, from her stores.\n4\tReturn to Bergil\tBergil stands before the Old Guest-house, south of the City Gates. You should return to Bergil with the small ale you have gathered.\n5\tGo to the Lower Stores\tThe Lower Stores are just south of the City Gates in the First Circle. Bergil has asked you to procure some victual packages from the butteries of the Lower Stores, which contain some dried meat.\n6\tGather victuals (total: 9)\tThe Lower Stores are just south of the City Gates in the First Circle. Gather parcels of soldiers' victuals from the buttery in the Lower Stores.\n7\tReturn to Bergil\tBergil stands before the Old Guest-house, south of the City Gates. You should return to Bergil with the soldiers' victuals.\n8\tFind Landath\tThe Wrights' Market is in the southern reach of the First Circle. Check in the Wrights' Market to see what's become of Landath, who was supposed to be procuring candles there.\n9\tTalk to the chandler\tChandler's Lane is on the southern reach of the First Circle. Find out why the chandler is berating Landath out in the street.\n10\tTalk to Landath\tLandath stands accused in Chandler's Lane, which is on the southern reach of the First Circle. Talk to Landath to hear his side of the story.\n11\tTalk to the chandler\tChandler's Lane is on the southern reach of the First Circle. Vouch for Landath to the chandler.\n12\tReturn to Bergil\tThe Old Guest-house lies in the First Circle, just south of the City Gates. Go back to Bergil at the Old Guest-house to see how the Gathering preparations are faring.\n",
[5794]="70009E7E\n1\tTalk to Pip Diggins\030Collect Hoarhallow ale (total: 10)\tGrothum lies north of Ost Ringdyr. Pip Diggins is located within the safety of Ost Ringdyr near the cooking oven. Pip Diggins would like you to recover some of the ale the goblins stole in exchange for a small reward.\n",
[5795]="7005AAF2\n1\tDestroy Angmarim gifts (total: 5)\030Destroy hobgoblin gifts (total: 5)\tAngmarim and hobgoblin gifts can be found inside the giant-hold of Thyrstáth. You should destroy Angmarim and hobgoblin gifts.\n2\tCall Hórin and talk to him\tUse the summoning horn to call Hórin to your side. You should talk to Hórin.\n",
[5796]="7006B710\n1\tPlant saplings (total: 5)\tYou have been directed to plant saplings in Arwáth, in the places where they have the best chance to grow.\n2\tTalk to Shanthar\tYou have planted saplings in Arwáth where you feel they have the best chance to grow. You should return to Shanthar.\n",
[5797]="70032BF3\n1\tDerrota a los capitanes Durub en Gazatu-ru\tLos capitanes Durub están en Gazatu-ru, en el Gran Salón de Durin y al sur de la Sala Vigesimoprimera. Deberías derrotar a los capitanes Durub, ya que son los responsables de la buena organización de los orcos de Gazatu-ru.\n2\tDerrota a los capitanes Durub en Gazatu-ru (total: 4)\tLos capitanes Durub están en Gazatu-ru, en el Gran Salón de Durin y al sur de la Sala Vigesimoprimera. Deberías derrotar a los capitanes Durub, ya que son los responsables de la buena organización de los orcos de Gazatu-ru.\n3\tHabla con Dómárr\tDómarr está en su campamento en el Gran Salón de Durin. Dómárr se alegrará de escuchar que los capitanes Durub han sido derrotados y que la organización de la tribu se ha venido abajo.\n",
[5798]="7004544B\n1\tSpeak with Rhûd-pulo-Drât\tRhûd-pulo-Drât can be found in Drû Bhûta. You should speak with Rhûd-pulo-Drât.\n2\tSpeak with Rhûd-pulo-Drât\tRhûd-pulo-Drât can be found in Drû Bhûta. You should speak with Rhûd-pulo-Drât.\n",
[5799]="70003299\n1\tHabla con Glamír\tGlamir vive cerca de unas antiguas ruinas élficas en el extremo sur de las Aguas Lúgubres, al noreste del bastión de los enanos de Gondamon. Se llega a Gondamon yendo hacia el norte por la carretera y luego tomando la bifurcación oeste. Calengil te ha enviado para hablar con su hermano menor, Glamir, y prestarle la ayuda que puedas.\n",
[5800]="700072F0\n1\tRecoge los racimos de uva de las vides (total: 6)\tLas vides fértiles crecen alrededor de un lago en un valle protegido, al oeste a lo largo del camino de piedra bajo Brethilwen. Debes tener cuidado con los trasgos. Brethilwen te ha pedido que recojas las uvas restantes del Viñedo de Limael.\n2\tLleva las uvas a Brethilwen\tBrethilwen está en Celondim, al sureste del Viñedo de Limael. Debes volver a Brethilwen con tu cosecha.\n",
[5801]="70071CCC\n1\tSearch for Glimglam at the Hold of Jalkhíla\tMashûmi believes Glimglam was captured by brigands and brought back to the Hold of Jalkhíla. Explore the Hold of Jalkhíla and search for Glimglam. The Hold of Jalkhíla can be found north of Sen Chatâk.\n2\tOpen Glimglam's cage to free him\tOpen Glimglam's cage to free him.\n3\tReturn to Mashûmi in Sen Chatâk and let her know her tortoise is now free.\t\n4\tReturn to Mashûmi in Sen Chatâk\tReturn to Mashûmi in Sen Chatâk and let her know her tortoise is now free.\n",
[5802]="70050B44\n1\tDerrota a Thruglok, el supervisor de la mina\tEncuentra y derrota a Thruglok, el supervisor de la mina.\n2\tEncuentra y derrota a Gast y Nûl, líderes de la mina\tEncuentra y derrota a Gast y Nûl, los jefes de la operación minera de Gundabad.\n",
[5803]="7004E74C\n1\tDerrota a Thruglok, el supervisor de la mina\tEncuentra y derrota a Thruglok, el supervisor de la mina.\n2\tEncuentra y derrota a Gast y Nûl, líderes de la mina\tEncuentra y derrota a Gast y Nûl, los jefes de la operación minera de Gundabad.\n",
