[5806]="700509C5\n1\tDefeat invaders within Glimmerdeep (total: 20)\tDefeat invaders within Glimmerdeep.\n2\tCompletado\tDefeat invaders within Glimmerdeep.\n",
[5807]="700509C8\n1\tDefeat Blogdob\tDefeat Blogdob within Glimmerdeep.\n2\tHabla con Stráhek el Robusto\tYou should return to to Stráhek the Stout in Skarháld and let him know of your victory at Glimmerdeep.\n",
[5808]="700509C9\n1\tGather rare gemstones (total: 8)\tGather rare gemstones.\n2\tCompletado\tGather rare gemstones.\n",
[5809]="7004E491\n1\tThe rivers of the Ironfold can be found flowing from the Iron Hills. Kári hopes to impress Foreman Brumbur by proving that panning the rivers of the Iron Hills might prove a substantial source of iron and other minerals.\t\n2\tDeliver the glimmering fragments to Kári in Járnfast\tKári can be found among the ruined mines of Járnfast. After panning in the rivers and streams of the Iron Hills, you have collected a small amount of glimmering fragments. You should deliver them to Kári in Járnfast.\n",
[5810]="70047BD9\n1\tDefeat marsh-lights in the southern Dead Marshes (total: 12)\tMarsh-lights can be found in northern Dagorlad in the southern reaches of the Dead Marshes. You have come across a number of aggressive and distracting marsh-lights in the Dead Marshes. You should quiet them before leaving the area.\n2\tCompletado\tYou have defeated many marsh-lights in the southern reaches of the Dead Marshes.\n",
[5811]="7000A8D4\n1\tDerrota a Nengon\tNengon y sus esbirros aguaoscuras se encuentran en los estanques y jardines de Glinghant, más allá de la plaza de Clorhir. Harthadril te ha pedido que entres en Glinghant y derrotes a los aguaoscuras que han profanado su belleza.\n",
[5812]="70029B2B\n1\tHabla con Bron para ir al Pantano Bruno\tBron está en Galtrev. Debes hablar con Bron para comenzar tu expedición de pesca en el Pantano Bruno. NOTA: Debes tener entrenado el pasatiempo de pesca para completar esta misión. NOTA: Esta es una misión en solitario y no puede completarse en una comunidad.\n2\tHabla con Bron en Galtrev\tBron está en Galtrev en el marcador de hito en el centro del pueblo. Debes hablar con Bron para recoger tu recompensa.\n",
[5813]="7005F6B6\n1\tDefeat glass-spiders in Glittengrof\tGlass-spiders can be found in Glittengrof in Gloomingtarn. While exploring Glittengrof, you have encountered an invasive swarm of glass-spiders dwelling among the ancient crystal-lodes of Mount Gundabad. You should defeat glass-spiders in Glittengrof.\n2\tDefeat glass-spiders in Glittengrof (total: 16)\tGlass-spiders can be found in Glittengrof in Gloomingtarn. While exploring Glittengrof, you have encountered an invasive swarm of glass-spiders dwelling among the ancient crystal-lodes of Mount Gundabad. You should defeat glass-spiders in Glittengrof.\n3\tCompletado\tYou have defeated many of the invasive glass-spiders in Glittengrof.\n",
[5814]="70052CE7\n1\tDefeat wandering glooms (total: 10)\tWandering glooms can be found along the river Gladden. You should defeat wandering glooms.\n2\tCompletado\tDefeated many wandering glooms.\n",
[5815]="7005A746\n1\tDefeat Drôk-and-Kharb\tDefeat Drôk-and-Kharb.\n2\tHabla con Zádokh Ojo de Sílex\tYou should return to Zádokh Flint-eye and apprise him of your efforts.\n",
[5816]="7005A73B\n1\tCollect flint (total: 10)\tCollect flint.\n",
[5817]="7005A73A\n1\tDerrota a los trolls (total: 15)\tDefeat trolls.\n",
[5818]="7004D372\n1\tDefeat Gloomthorn\tGloomthorn can be found patrolling Eryn Lasgalen. You have encountered the vile Gloomthorn. Roaming the Mirkwood, the corrupted Huorn lurks amongst the trees.\n2\tDefeat Gloomthorn\tGloomthorn can be found patrolling Eryn Lasgalen. You have encountered the vile Gloomthorn. Roaming the Mirkwood, the corrupted Huorn lurks amongst the trees.\n3\tCompletado\tYou have defeated Gloomthorn.\n",
[5819]="70009F56\n1\tHabla con Culang\tCulang está en Tinnudir, una isla frente a la orilla este del Lago Evendim, al oeste de las Quebradas del Norte. Glorfindel te ha pedido que busques a su antigua compañera de batalla Erchiel, de quien se dice que vive cerca del Lago Evendim. Te envió primero a hablar con el montaraz Culang en Tinnudir, pues puede que él sepa dónde encontrarla.\n2\tHabla con Erchiel\tErchiel puede encontrarse en una arboleda en la orilla noroeste del Lago Evendim, junto a un arroyo que desemboca en el lago. Culang te recibió cordialmente, pero confesó que nunca había oído el nombre de Erchiel. Aun así, sugirió que quizá pudiera encontrarse en o cerca de una arboleda extraña en la orilla oeste del Lago Evendim, aunque te advirtió que la zona es muy peligrosa.\n",
[5820]="7000B938\n1\tRegresa con Nogmeldir con el arco de Glorwen\030Encuentra alguna señal de Glorwen entre las ruinas de los gigantes\tLas ruinas de gigantes de Starkhath están muy al este. Nogmeldir te ha pedido que busques señales de la exploradora elfa Glorwen en las ruinas infestadas de huargos.\n",
[5821]="7001757F\n1\tRecoge glándulas aromáticas de la araña Luillë\tLuillë se encuentra en las Vetas del Cuerno Rojo, al norte de la Fosa de las Garras y justo al oeste de las Fundaciones de Piedra. Valthor te ha pedido que derrotes a la araña Luillë y le lleves sus glándulas aromáticas.\n2\tHabla con Valthor en el Refugio Sombrío\tValthor está en el Refugio Sombrío, al este de las Vetas del Cuerno Rojo. Deberías regresar junto a Valthor con las glándulas de Luillë.\n",
[5822]="7006B587\n1\tDefeat a glory-seeking enemy\tAmong the enemies of Angmar is an audacious firebrand intent on slaughtering all that they can. Hunt them down and claim their bounty. Only Glory Seeking Monster Players count toward the advance of this quest.\n",
[5823]="7006B5A7\n1\tDefeat enemies of the Free People ([según el diario]/5)\tSeek glory across the Ettenmoors by bringing the enemy low. The more enemies you defeat the more powerful you will become.\n2\tDefeat enemies of the Free People (total: 5)\tContinue seeking glory across the Ettenmoors by bringing the enemy low. The more enemies you defeat the more powerful you will become.\n3\tDefeat enemies of the Free People (total: 5)\tContinue seeking glory across the Ettenmoors by bringing the enemy low. The more enemies you defeat the more powerful you will become.\n4\tDefeat enemies of the Free People (total: 5)\tSeek glory across the Ettenmoors by bringing the enemy low. The more enemies you defeat the more powerful you will become.\n5\tDefeat enemies of the Free People (total: 5)\tSeek glory across the Ettenmoors by bringing the enemy low. The more enemies you defeat the more powerful you will become.\n",
[5824]="7006B586\n1\tSlaughter the Free People (total: 5)\tScour the Ettenmoors for the enemies of Angmar and eliminate them where they are found. Slaughter for the glory of Angmar!\n2\tSlaughter the Free People (total: 5)\tScour the Ettenmoors for the enemies of Angmar and eliminate them where they are found. Slaughter for the glory of Angmar!\n3\tSlaughter the Free People (total: 5)\tScour the Ettenmoors for the enemies of Angmar and eliminate them where they are found. Slaughter for the glory of Angmar!\n4\tSlaughter the Free People (total: 5)\tScour the Ettenmoors for the enemies of Angmar and eliminate them where they are found. Slaughter for the glory of Angmar!\n5\tSlaughter the Free People (total: 5)\tScour the Ettenmoors for the enemies of Angmar and eliminate them where they are found. Slaughter for the glory of Angmar!\n",
